  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CI WASH Working Group Annual Meeting - 2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will provide subsidies for members of the CI WASH Working Group (WG) that can not afford to attend the annual meeting in Rome (25 - 27 June 2018). International members that have general funds for such occasions (CAFOD, CRS, Trocaire, Cordaid) are not eligible for such assistance.  Those expected to apply are Caritas Bangladesh, Caritas Uganda, Caritas Congo, and possibly Caritas India, Caritas Nepal, and Caritas Rwanda.</narrative>
  </description>
